sequenceDiagram
  participant P as Python (CPU)
  participant T as PyTorch dispatcher (CPU)
  participant B as cuBLAS (CPU)
  participant S as CUDA stream (queue)
  participant G as GPU SMs
  P->>T: c = a @ b
  T->>B: CUDA tensors: call the GEMM routine
  B->>S: launch a GEMM kernel
  S->>G: kernel starts
  B-->>P: return, about 0.2 ms after the call
  Note over P: Python runs the next lines
  Note over G: 24 SMs compute for about 25 ms
  P->>S: torch.cuda.synchronize()
  G-->>S: kernel finished
  S-->>P: synchronize returns, c is ready
